ined\",\"errorScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{}],\"templateStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"templateScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"notFound\":\"$undefined\",\"forbidden\":\"$undefined\",\"unauthorized\":\"$undefined\"}]]}],{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[\"$L4\",[[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-0\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/0xv9uz7g8af6d.js\",\"async\":true,\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}]],[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$6\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@7\"}]}]]}],{},null,false,null]},null,false,\"$@8\"]},null,false,\"$@8\"]},null,false,\"$@8\"]},null,false,null],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L9\",null,{\"children\":\"$La\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$Lb\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$6\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":\"$Lc\"}]}]}],[\"$\",\"meta\",null,{\"name\":\"next-size-adjust\",\"content\":\"\"}]]}],false]],\"m\":\"$undefined\",\"G\":[\"$d\",[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/chunks/0-7zhabl4g7ue.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\",\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}]]],\"S\":true,\"h\":null,\"s\":\"$undefined\",\"l\":\"$undefined\",\"p\":\"$undefined\",\"d\":\"$undefined\",\"b\":\"CCxR80sZRnjlIdOoXSFK7\"}\ne:[]\n8:\"$We\"\nf:I[22016,[\"/_next/static/chunks/01xlw8hd842-c.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0xv9uz7g8af6d.js\"],\"\"]\n10:I[16505,[\"/_next/static/chunks/01xlw8hd842-c.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0xv9uz7g8af6d.js\"],\"LessonClient\"]\n11:T8dc,# Managing SharePoint Sites and Lists\n\nOnce connected with `Connect-PnPOnline`, you can create and manage SharePoint sites, lists, and columns entirely from PowerShell.\n\n## Getting Site Information\n\nRetrieve details about the site you are connected to:\n\n```powershell\nGet-PnPSite                   # Returns the site collection object\nGet-PnPWeb                    # Returns the current web (subsite) object\nGet-PnPWeb | Select-Object Title, Url, Language\n```\n\n> **Key Concept:** In SharePoint, a **site collection** (returned by `Get-PnPSite`) is the top-level container. A **web** (returned by `Get-PnPWeb`) is an individual site or subsite within that collection.\n\n## Creating New Sites\n\nUse `New-PnPSite` to create communication or team sites. The `-Type` parameter controls which kind:\n\n```powershell\n# Communication site\nNew-PnPSite -Type CommunicationSite -Title \"Company News\" `\n    -Url \"https://contoso.sharepoint.com/sites/CompanyNews\"\n\n# Team site (backed by an M365 Group)\nNew-PnPSite -Type TeamSite -Title \"Engineering\" -Alias \"Engineering\"\n```\n\nCommunication sites are for broadcasting content. Team sites are collaboration spaces tied to a Microsoft 365 Group.\n\n## Working with Lists\n\nLists are the core data structure in SharePoint. Retrieve, create, and remove them with these cmdlets:\n\n```powershell\n# Get all lists on the current site\nGet-PnPList\n\n# Get a specific list by title\nGet-PnPList -Identity \"Projects\"\n\n# Create a new generic list\nNew-PnPList -Title \"Inventory\" -Template GenericList\n\n# Create a document library\nNew-PnPList -Title \"Proposals\" -Template DocumentLibrary\n```\n\n## Adding Columns (Fields)\n\nAfter creating a list, add custom columns with `Add-PnPField`:\n\n```powershell\nAdd-PnPField -List \"Inventory\" -DisplayName \"SKU\" `\n    -InternalName \"SKU\" -Type Text\n\nAdd-PnPField -List \"Inventory\" -DisplayName \"Quantity\" `\n    -InternalName \"Quantity\" -Type Number\n```\n\n> **Key Concept:** Always specify both `-DisplayName` (what users see) and `-InternalName` (used in code and queries). The internal name cannot be changed after creation, so choose it carefully.\n\n## Removing a List\n\nTo delete a list, use `Remove-PnPList`. Add `-Force` to skip the confirmation prompt:\n\n```powershell\nRemove-PnPList -Identity \"Inventory\" -Force\n```\n4:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-h-screen bg-zinc-950 text-zinc-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"header\",null,{\"className\":\"sticky top-0 z-10 border-b border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/80 backdrop-blur-xl\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto flex max-w-4xl items-center justify-between px-6 py-3.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$Lf\",null,{\"href\":\"/module/sharepoint-m365\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-zinc-500 transition-colors hover:text-zinc-300\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-4 w-4\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M10.5 19.5L3 12m0 0l7.5-7.5M3 12h18\"}]}],\"SharePoint & M365 PowerShell\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$Lf\",null,{\"href\":\"/module/sharepoint-m365/connecting-to-m365\",\"className\":\"flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-zinc-800 text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:border-zinc-700 hover:text-zinc-200\",\"title\":\"Connecting to M365\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-4 w-4\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M15.75 19.5L8.25 12l7.5-7.5\"}]}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs tabular-nums text-zinc-500\",\"children\":[2,\" / \",8]}],[\"$\",\"$Lf\",null,{\"href\":\"/module/sharepoint-m365/site-permissions\",\"className\":\"flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-zinc-800 text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:border-zinc-700 hover:text-zinc-200\",\"title\":\"Managing Site Permissions\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-4 w-4\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"strokeWidt